ion":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-08-04T23:35:32Z","updated_at":"2026-08-05T09:12:45Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in Godot 4.7.stable\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 10 - Godot 4.7.stable - Vulkan (Mobile) - Integrated Intel HD Graphics 620 - Intel Core i5-7200U - Intel Quick Sync H.264\n\n### Issue description\n\nI ran into a problem when recording a Godot 4 project with OBS Studio.\n\nThe game itself runs fine when played normally, but when OBS starts recording, the recorded video has stuttering and dropped frames.\n\nOBS shows:\n- Rendering lag (frames missed due to rendering delay)\n- Encoding lag (frames lost due to encoding)\n\nThe problem happens with the Mobile Vulkan renderer. Other 3D applications/games do not show this behavior on the same PC.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Crear o abrir un proyecto 3D de Godot 4.\n2. Usar el renderizador móvil (Vulkan).\n3. Ejecutar/exportar el proyecto.\n4. Grabarlo usando OBS Studio.\n5. Observar fotogramas perdidos en OBS y saltos en la grabación.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nThe issue is easier to notice in moderately complex 3D scenes. Very simple scenes may not reproduce the problem.\n\n[test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30723455/test.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122108/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122108/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}